        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Oh, that's Count Barzok! :D I always forget about him. Feels like he should be a more present character than he is.\n\nYay for Waykeep, the best new character!\n\nOkay, but they could send him to the same place the Seer went, and the Seer's the one who turns him back to people, and tries to extort him for some kind of plot. That would make a good story!\n\nGood call on Free Radical as a potential Scholar rememberer. :O Even if it didn't work out.\n\n\"What's your game, hot dog man?\" is just perfect 90's \"demonstrating how unnecessarily edgy this character is\" dialogue. :D\n\nI'm so glad they got my reference. :)\n\nGhost Viper being afraid of snakes is brilliant. \"Painsnake\" sounds like a bad story idea that turns Painstake into some kind of snake monster so she has an easier time defeating him.\n\nYes, a gothed-up version of one of the Kids' Club Virtuosos! :D I love it!\n\nHey, episode 2 of Play Greater was pretty good, I think SkyWhale's on to something! :)\n\nTrevor leaving in the reverb while Adam is laughing is one of the funniest moments of this podcast. XD Also, yay for Gumbo!\n\nWhat a great thing to do at the end of this episode, too. :)",
