      {
        "id": 249870,
        "name": "",
        "username": "skywhale",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/skywhale/{size}/5248_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-12-06T20:01:28.459Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think “orphan factory” just proves my point that their banter is great on second episodes!</p>\n<p>I’m so glad they decided to read that <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/laughing.png?v=12\" title=\":laughing:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":laughing:\"></p>\n<p>There really is something to say about them having already been warmed up and into the “podcasting mood”, though. And now I really need to check out Play Greater!</p>\n<p>And yeah, really glad that did that at the end of the podcast.</p>",
